---
import tad from '../content/assisted-driving.json';
import { ROUTES, formatDayIt } from '../consts';
import Button from './Button.astro';

const approved = formatDayIt(tad.approvedOn);
---

<section class="pb-16 md:pb-24" aria-labelledby="tad-banner-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] bg-night text-night-ink"
    >
      <div class="md:col-span-5" data-m="curtain">
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 640 440"
          class="block h-full w-full"
          role="img"
          aria-labelledby="tad-img-title"
          preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"
        >
          <title id="tad-img-title">
            Bandiera italiana con la scritta «Approvato e utilizzabile»: la guida assistita Tesla in
            Italia
          </title>
          <rect width="640" height="440" fill="#14151a"></rect>
          <!-- Strada in prospettiva -->
          <path d="M250 440 L305 250 L335 250 L390 440 Z" fill="#1f2229"></path>
          <path d="M318 270 L322 270 L326 310 L314 310 Z" fill="#f2f2f0" opacity="0.5"></path>
          <path d="M313 330 L327 330 L332 385 L308 385 Z" fill="#f2f2f0" opacity="0.6"></path>
          <path d="M303 405 L337 405 L341 440 L299 440 Z" fill="#f2f2f0" opacity="0.7"></path>
          <!-- Bandiera che sventola -->
          <g transform="translate(150 54)">
            <rect x="-6" y="-8" width="6" height="250" rx="3" fill="#9ba0ab"></rect>
            <path d="M0 0 C40 -10 70 10 113 0 L113 170 C70 180 40 160 0 170 Z" fill="#009246"></path>
            <path d="M113 0 C153 -10 183 10 226 0 L226 170 C183 180 153 160 113 170 Z" fill="#f4f5f0"></path>
            <path d="M226 0 C266 -10 296 10 340 0 L340 170 C296 180 266 160 226 170 Z" fill="#ce2b37"></path>
            <path
              d="M0 0 C40 -10 70 10 113 0 C153 -10 183 10 226 0 C266 -10 296 10 340 0 L340 40 C296 50 266 30 226 40 C183 50 153 30 113 40 C70 50 40 30 0 40 Z"
              fill="#ffffff"
              opacity="0.08"
            ></path>
          </g>
          <!-- Etichetta -->
          <g transform="translate(320 292)">
            <rect x="-196" y="-30" width="392" height="60" rx="30" fill="#2fa98d"></rect>
            <circle cx="-160" cy="0" r="17" fill="#14151a"></circle>
            <path
              d="M-168 0 L-162 7 L-151 -7"
              fill="none"
              stroke="#2fa98d"
              stroke-width="4.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            ></path>
            <text
              x="14"
              y="8"
              text-anchor="middle"
              font-family="Space Grotesk, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif"
              font-size="25"
              font-weight="700"
              fill="#14151a"
              letter-spacing="0.5">APPROVATO E UTILIZZABILE</text
            >
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-7 px-7 py-10 md:px-12 md:py-12">
        <p class="caption-14 m-0 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-night-soft">
          Novità del {approved}
        </p>
        <h2 id="tad-banner-title" class="heading-28 m-0 mt-3 text-night-ink">
          La guida assistita Tesla (ex FSD) è approvata in Italia
        </h2>
        <p class="body-18 m-0 mt-4 text-night-soft">
          Con la tua supervisione l'auto guida quasi ovunque, anche in città. Si usa appena l'auto
          riceve l'aggiornamento, che sta arrivando in questi giorni. Costa {tad.monthlyPrice} € al
          mese in abbonamento; per ora serve l'Hardware 4. E dalle Tesla ordinate adesso è sparito
          l'Autopilot di serie.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <Button variant="primary" href={ROUTES.assistedDriving} icon="arrow-right">
            Come funziona e quanto costa
          </Button>
          <Button variant="on-dark" href={ROUTES.autopilot}>Cosa cambia per Autopilot</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
